refused: d102_empty_on_list_with_min.cy:5:72, line 5 column 72
 5 |     let $b: std::coll::list<i32>[len.min: 1 items, len.max: 8 items] = empty;
   |                                                                        ^^^^^
 what: `std::coll::list<i32>[len.min: 1 items, len.max: 8 items]` can't be `empty`
 why:  `empty` is refused where it can't be true, so a list with `len.min` above 0 can't use it (D102, D103)
